  "description": "STAF.LLMEval is a .NET library and AI testing framework for evaluating LLM and GenAI responses in unit tests and CI/CD. Score AI outputs with pluggable metrics (exact, keyword, TF-IDF semantic similarity, JSON/schema validation, relevance, heuristic grounding), LLM-as-judge, and RAG groundedness / hallucination detection. Includes fluent Eval API, rich assertions (ShouldPass / ShouldMeetPassRate), EvalTraits for test filtering, Options/DI, JSON/JSONL/CSV evaluation suites with tags, golden baseline comparison, HTML/JSON/Markdown/CSV reports, and GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps CI templates with pass-rate gates and report artifacts. Works with OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Google Gemini, and Ollama on .NET 8/9/10.",
