  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "STAF.LLMEval 2.2.0 — Test Framework & CI Reporting\n\n- Richer assertion messages (metric, grounding, usage, optional because) + ShouldMeetPassRate for suite CI gates\n- EvalTraits constants for xUnit/MSTest/NUnit filtering (Category / Kind / Tag)\n- Suite case tags + FilterByTags; CSV tags column\n- ReportPaths.LLMEVAL_REPORT_DIR for CI artifact directories\n- Official GitHub Actions + Azure DevOps sample pipelines with pass-rate fail + report artifacts\n- No separate MSTest/xUnit/NUnit packages — main-package asserts remain framework-agnostic\n\nSee https://github.com/sooraj171/LLMEval/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
